<title>BELGIUM: EU commissioner cancels visit to Cambodia.</title>
<headline>EU commissioner cancels visit to Cambodia.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commissioner with responsibility for relations with Indochina has cancelled a visit to Cambodia following a bloody coup that further entrenched co-premier Hun Sen.</p>
<p>A European Commission official said Manuel Marin had cancelled a visit to Cambodia on July 29 but will press ahead with travelling to Malaysia and Laos.</p>
<p>The EU has been strongly critical of Hun Sen since he ousted co-premier Prince Norodom Ranariddh on July 5 and is examining whether to cut aid in protest.</p>
</text>
